    "detailed_description": "<h1>Chesskoban Bishop now available!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784220/extras/7b23a370368b1211aba9d7df45d8d37d.avif?t=1646084736\" /></div><br><br>Chesskoban is a Puzzle game with the combination of Chess mechanics and Sokoban game for chess lovers and beginners.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784220/extras/79e421ac6fd0beb55ac382fb944b7f27.avif?t=1646084736\" /></div><br><br>The Player which is an original piece created based on the King (is the character<br> that will move the knights ) he is the only exception, all other pieces in the game are white and black knights. You will control the white horses, needing to reposition them to capture the black horses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784220/extras/a61bffb7c42717a5f3e70839618299c6.poster.avif?t=1646084736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784220/extras/a61bffb7c42717a5f3e70839618299c6.webm?t=1646084736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784220/extras/a61bffb7c42717a5f3e70839618299c6.mp4?t=1646084736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784220/extras/91156907334a5119645f8a68e8599d9a.avif?t=1646084736\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 hand-crafted levels with increasing complexity.<br></li><li>Relaxing composed Soundtracks<br></li><li>Beautiful minimalist aesthetic<br></li><li>Playable with keyboard.<br></li><li>Isometric and perspective camera modes.<br></li><li>Undo and Redo moves.</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784220/extras/2e6985ae469177b2dc5f6b8dbe77dac2.avif?t=1646084736\" /></div><br><br>We are Heimo, a Brazilian indie game development studio created by brothers who love games. By purchasing, playing and evaluating our game you will help our indie journey \u2665. Heimo means &quot;Tribe&quot;, it means teamwork, continuous learning and we are looking every day to create better games and bring the best experience and fun to our players. Feel free to contact us.",
